# BEN Engine gateway — Mosquitto ACL (generated by install.sh from UNIT id and node count)
# A node may publish only on its own telemetry/status/ack topics and read only its own cmd topic.
# The API service (user "benapi") reads everything and writes cmd/equip/alarm/twin topics.
# __UNIT__ is replaced at install time.

user benapi
topic readwrite ben/__UNIT__/#

user dashboard
topic read ben/__UNIT__/#

# --- one block per node (appended by install.sh) ---
# user nodeN
# topic write ben/__UNIT__/node/nodeN/telemetry
# topic write ben/__UNIT__/node/nodeN/status
# topic write ben/__UNIT__/node/nodeN/ack
# topic read  ben/__UNIT__/node/nodeN/cmd
